'''Fiend''' is a {{Mythical}} [[mutation]] of [[Yeti]].

Fiend grants the user the ability to manipulate and imbue their attacks with fire/energy, turning them into powerful and destructive attacks, along with transforming into a fiend, enhancing their already powerful and dangerous attacks even further, also healing people in their own crew. The transformation also grants additional perks such as increased durability, increased healing, enhanced physical abilities, and powerful flaming attacks.

The Fiend mutation has slightly lower defense compared to [[Yeti]], exchanging it for much higher damage, combo potential and superior mobility and healing.

Fiend also possesses a custom Super Dash, quite similar to [[Rabbit|Rabbit's]] awakened '''Lightning Cloak''' gear. The move deals damage, stuns, and works aerially.

==Obtainment==
As a limited [[Mutation]], Fiend had different obtainment methods compared to ordinary [[Blox Fruits]]. Players were able to obtain it by:
* Rolling it through the limited-time [[Valentines Gacha Dealer]].
* Buying it with {{Robux|1,500}} from the mutations section of the Yeti fruit. (Must own [[Permanent Blox Fruits|Permanent]] [[Yeti]] first).
* Purchasing the [[Shop|Raging Frost Bundle]] during the 2026 Valentine's Event.
* Finding it under [[Trees]], during its respective event.
* [[Trading]] for it, with it being a special item.

